cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "equal-divisor-sums-lean4: A Lean 4 proof of Erdős Problem 824"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 proof that the number h(x) of coprime pairs 1 ≤ a < b < x with
  σ(a) = σ(b) exceeds x^(2-ε) for every ε > 0 and all large x (Erdős Problem 824),
  following Li and Zhuang's reduction to primes with smooth successors and an
  adaptation of the weighted-dilation-graph argument.
authors:
